{
  "id": "EXO.40",
  "number": "40",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Exodus 40",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "40",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 40"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "40",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah spake unto Moses, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the first day of the first month shalt thou rear up the tabernacle of the tent of meeting. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt put therein the ark of the testimony, and thou shalt screen the ark with the veil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt bring in the table, and set in order the things that are upon it; and thou shalt bring in the candlestick, and light the lamps thereof. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt set the golden altar for incense before the ark of the testimony, and put the screen of the door to the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt set the altar of burnt-offering before the door of the tabernacle of the tent of meeting. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt set the laver between the tent of meeting and the altar, and shalt put water therein. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt set up the court round about, and hang up the screen of the gate of the court. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt take the anointing oil, and anoint the tabernacle, and all that is therein, and shalt hallow it, and all the furniture thereof: and it shall be holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt anoint the altar of burnt-offering, and all its vessels, and sanctify the altar: and the altar shall be most holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt anoint the laver and its base, and sanctify it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt bring Aaron and his sons unto the door of the tent of meeting, and shalt wash them with water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt put upon Aaron the holy garments; and thou shalt anoint him, and sanctify him, that he may minister unto me in the priest’s office. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt bring his sons, and put coats upon them; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and thou shalt anoint them, as thou didst anoint their father, that they may minister unto me in the priest’s office: and their anointing shall be to them for an everlasting priesthood throughout their generations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus did Moses: according to all that Jehovah commanded him, so did he.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass in the first month in the second year, on the first day of the month, that the tabernacle was reared up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses reared up the tabernacle, and laid its sockets, and set up the boards thereof, and put in the bars thereof, and reared up its pillars. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he spread the tent over the tabernacle, and put the covering of the tent above upon it; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took and put the testimony into the ark, and set the staves on the ark, and put the mercy-seat above upon the ark: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he brought the ark into the tabernacle, and set up the veil of the screen, and screened the ark of the testimony; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the table in the tent of meeting, upon the side of the tabernacle northward, without the veil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he set the bread in order upon it before Jehovah; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the candlestick in the tent of meeting, over against the table, on the side of the tabernacle southward. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he lighted the lamps before Jehovah; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the golden altar in the tent of meeting before the veil: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he burnt thereon incense of sweet spices; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the screen of the door to the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he set the altar of burnt-offering at the door of the tabernacle of the tent of meeting, and offered upon it the burnt-offering and the meal-offering; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he set the laver between the tent of meeting and the altar, and put water therein, wherewith to wash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses and Aaron and his sons washed their hands and their feet thereat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when they went into the tent of meeting, and when they came near unto the altar, they washed; as Jehovah commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he reared up the court round about the tabernacle and the altar, and set up the screen of the gate of the court. So Moses finished the work.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the cloud covered the tent of meeting, and the glory of Jehovah filled the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses was not able to enter into the tent of meeting, because the cloud abode thereon, and the glory of Jehovah filled the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the cloud was taken up from over the tabernacle, the children of Israel went onward, throughout all their journeys: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
